  "description": "P6 fully-random wavelength-label ablation -- literal sampled values for both draws. Unlike P1-P4/P5, these values are pure independent draws from Uniform(400, 2500) nm with NO relationship to any real band center, so they cannot be regenerated from a known-band-center formula -- this file is the authoritative record. Algorithm: rejection-sampled np.random.default_rng(seed).uniform(400, 2500, size=n), resampled until all pairwise distances in the sorted draw are >=5nm (a degeneracy guard, not a physical constraint).",
